  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic, curry powder, turmeric, cumin, salt, and pepper, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the lardons and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in the yogurt and bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook, covered, until the sauce has thickened, about 10 minutes.",
